OL,5,G1500 Undercover Boss USA
OL,6,     FDan Duffy, CEO of the United Real
OL,7,     FEstate Group, goes undercover in
OL,8,     Fhis own firm. He meets different
OL,9,     Femployees and learns about their
OL,10,     Fprofessional and personal lives.
OL,11,G1600 Ramsay's Kitchen Nightmares USA
OL,12,     FNino's: Gordon visits Long Beach
OL,13,     Fin California to save Nino's, a
OL,14,     Ffailing Italian restaurant that
OL,15,     Fopened in 1958 and is now under
OL,16,     Fthe misguided leadership of eldest
OL,17,     Fson Nino.
