OL,5,G1700 Ramsay's Kitchen Nightmares USA
OL,6,     FMill Street Bistro (Part 1/2): The
OL,7,     Fowner of the Mill Street Bistro in
OL,8,     FOhio claims to have the best menu
OL,9,     Fbetween New York and LA. But the
OL,10,     Fdiners don't agree.
OL,11,G1800 Ramsay's Kitchen Nightmares USA
OL,12,     FMill Street Bistro (Part 2/2): In
OL,13,     Fthe conclusion to the Mill Street
OL,14,     FBistro saga, Gordon's disagreement
OL,15,     Fwith the proprietor erupts into
OL,16,     Fone of his most intense
OL,17,     Fconfrontations yet.
