OL,5,G1900 Ramsay's Kitchen Nightmares USA
OL,6,     FYanni's: Gordon Ramsay visits
OL,7,     FGreek restaurant Yanni's, where he
OL,8,     Fclashes with owner Peter, a chef
OL,9,     Fwho hasn't changed his menu since
OL,10,     Fthe business opened in 1984.
OL,11,G2000 Ramsay's Kitchen Nightmares USA
OL,12,     FThe Prohibition Grille: Gordon
OL,13,     Fvisits the Prohibition Grille in
OL,14,     FWashington State, where
OL,15,     Frestaurateur Rishi is oblivious to
OL,16,     Fthe disastrous dishes being made
OL,17,     Fin her own kitchen.
